    "description": "Two units in a prime location directly across from the University of San Francisco. This charming building is bathed in natural light, offering a bright and welcoming atmosphere. Each unit has spacious living room, formal dining room, kitchen , two generously sized bedrooms, and a full bathroom.  The ground floor includes two private one-car garages, a laundry room, and additional storage for convenience. Residents may also enjoy eligibility for membership at the Koret Health and Recreation Center, with easy access to Golden Gate Park and public transportation. Don't miss this exceptional opportunity!   2338 Golden Gate Avenue has a protected tenant and 2336 is currently occupied by a family member.    2342-2344 Golden Gate Avenue, the adjacent building,  is also being offered for sale."
